<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets warrants on Novartis.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets warrants on Novartis.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on Novartis Namen, lead manager Bankers Trust AG said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 200 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2650 CHF		  PREMIUM	16.80 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.16 CHF		  GEARING	10.81 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	18.SEP.98		 PAYDATE	21.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  2464 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
